MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_001: Hey! We arrived at the palace. It's pretty hectic here,\nwhat with the time for battle getting closer.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_002: I wonder if Theodora has already set out? Maybe I\nshould try asking around.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_003: The air around a palace on the eve of battle is a\nwonderful thing.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_004: I do not see Theodora. She will appear when the\nbattle begins, no doubt.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_005: Things are rather unsettled in the palace. I should\ntour the place before I speak with Bonaventure.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_007: I came all the way here to see Queen Theodora,\nand there's no sign of her.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_008: I could wait until the next battle to see her, or I\ncould try asking around.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_009: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_010: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_017: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_011: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_012: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_013: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c01_LG20_001_m01_014: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m02_001: I'm here to help!
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m02_002: Nice! With your help, I can take care of the animals.\nThanks, stable guy! 
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m02_003: <DLG>The stable is now available.
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m03_001: Hello! I came here because I heard a war broke out.\nI thought I'd offer folks some drinks.
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m03_002: Hey, I remember you from the tavern. Looking\nforward to seeing more of you.
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m03_004: A drink during a battle could be just the boost\nwe need. Thanks!
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m03_003: <DLG>Drink vendor is now available.
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m04_001: I've received an automaton from Smyrnos's temple.\nPlease speak to me about combat arts and secrets.
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m04_002: Hm. Well thought, Smyrnos. I will make use of this.
MID_LGV_2XXX_LG20_001_m04_003: <DLG>You can now strengthen combat arts and teach secrets.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m01_001: I see that the arena has been demolished, just as\nTroy claimed.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m01_002: Then the rumors of Dagda's cauldron being\nunearthed were true after all.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m01_003: Just as the scouts said, there's not a soul in sight.\nTotal silence... It's unsettling.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m01_004: If I recall, they said that only Dagda's temple\nremains unsearched.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m01_005: We'd better hurry. The temple is atop Temple Row,\nthe highest point of Dagsion.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m05_001: The port and residential area are at the bottom of\nthese stairs, but there's no sign of anybody there!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m05_002: This is...unbelievable. All the people can't have just\nvanished from Dagsion!
MID_LGA_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m05: <BLN>This is...unbelievable.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m06_001: The arena was enormous...and now it's gone.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m06_002: How was something so terrible hidden beneath it?
MID_LGA_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m06: <BLN>It boggles the mind...
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m07: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m07_001: Dagsion so calm and still is like a Midir Ocean\nwithout any waves. It's an eerie sight.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m07_002: Anything could still be lurking around here, so please\nbe careful.
MID_LGA_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m07: <BLN>Danger may still lurk here...
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m08: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m08_001: We've been searching for a while now, but we\nhaven't found so much as a cat past here!
MID_LGA_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m08: <BLN>I have a report.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m09: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m09_001: I can't believe it. Gods, humans, temple soldiers,\npriests, even livestock...all gone.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m09_002: What could have swept them all up like this?
MID_LGA_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m09: <BLN>What became of everyone?
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m10: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m10_001: I made a search of this temple, but found no signs\nof life inside.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m10_002: The Gate of the Gods was silent too. It looks to have\nbeen sealed off.
MID_LGA_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m10: <BLN>There's no one here!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m11: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m11_001: The only place we haven't investigated yet is Dagda's\ntemple up ahead.
MID_LGA_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m11: <BLN>Just one place left to look...
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_Note_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_Note_m01_001: <TLP>Every day, more people are brought out and thrown into\nDagda's cauldron. It was just prisoners from the dungeons\nat first, and everyone assumed he'd decided to execute\na few criminals.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_Note_m01_002: <TLP>But it didn't end there. After the colosseum was demolished,\nthe gladiators and arena staff were left with nowhere to go\nexcept into the cauldron. And now they've been bringing up\nthe residents of lowtown.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_Note_m01_003: <TLP>Those of us who live in the wealthier districts know we're\nnext if this continues, and we're out of our minds with fear.\nWe would flee, but all exits to Dagsion have been blocked off,\nwith no one permitted to leave...
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m02_001: There it is—Dagda's temple. And it appears to\nbe completely unguarded. Odd.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m02_002: Hmph. I am not one to decline such an open\ninvitation. We shall enter! Is everyone ready?
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_001: Dagda's cauldron... It's so big. I've seen it once, from\nbelow, but seeing it from here...
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_002: Why is this thing here? Why would anyone\nneed this?
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_003: Dagda's cauldron... A massive, ancient means\nof execution.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_004: I do not feel even the barest shred of beauty in\nthis thing.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_005: This is Dagda's cauldron? The yawning hole that\nswallowed the People of the White Egg and Yu Phas?
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_006: How horrid. I would bury it again right now if I\ncould. But we haven't the time to spare.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_007: I can't believe this is what was below the arena\nall along...
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_008: Likewise, we hardly know what's underneath\nour feet. Best to be careful.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_009: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_010: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_011: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_012: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_015: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c05_LG20_006_m03_016: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_Dagsion_Closed_Bel_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_Dagsion_Closed_Bel_m01_001: This is no time to take detours.
MID_LGV_2XXX_Dagsion_Closed_Seo_m01: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_Dagsion_Closed_Seo_m01_001: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_LG20_007_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_LG20_007_m01_001: I don't really get what's going on, but it seems bad.\nWe should hurry to Dagda's cauldron.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_LG20_007_m01_002: You entertain me endlessly, Lyrah. Await me!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_LG20_007_m01_003: The answers to any questions may lie in the ruins of\nthe arena. We must see it for ourselves.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_LG20_007_m01_004: Whatever's happening, I think we'd better hurry to\nDagda's cauldron!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_LG20_007_m01_005: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_LG20_007_m01_006: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_LG20_007_m01_008: 
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_001: Something's really wrong. It's like the underworld\nspilled into the outside world.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_002: Let's get out of here. We know our way through the\nsewers, so we should be OK.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_017: The underworld is overflowing! We have to run!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_003: What is this? An extraordinary presence surrounds\nus completely!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_004: We must flee. With haste.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_018: Death is all around...and this fascinates me. But we\nmust flee, and quick.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_005: The presence filling this area...you don't suppose it's\nin danger of overflowing to the outside, is it?
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_006: The question is academic for now. We must focus\non escape!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_019: This all feels like a waking nightmare. But we must\nfocus on escape!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_007: It's ominous... If I'm not wrong, the underworld is\novertaking a wide area.
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_008: Yeah, seems that way. Let's get out of here!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_020: I can't die here—I'm not going to throw away the life\nhe gave me!
MID_LGV_2XXX_c06_DN20_001_m01_009: 
